  "paradigm_pack_notes": "Nanochu is a relatively weak monster stat-wise. Using only Potent materials it can achieve just 3590 HP, 463 Strength, and 507 Magic. Its development is geared towards offense, being able to learn Bravery, Bravega, Faith, Vigilance, and all four En— spells. Even though it's a one-time monster, it could be beneficial to infuse Nanochu into other Synergists who lack offensive abilities or a monster in need of the Pack Mentality skill.\n\nEven though it has low HP, it has a lot of potential to become an offensive Synergist, as Noel can settle the defensive buffs. One way to make Nanochu not so fragile is to infuse Resist Physical: +36%, Resist Magic: +36%, and HP: +30%.",
